         measured: deep law: mu_2 = 2g/s => g^2 = (s/2) g_N = a_0 g_N; g = sqrt(a_0 g_N) = sqrt(a_0 G M)/r; rho_ph = (1/4 pi G r^2) d[r^2(g - g_N)]/dr = sqrt(a_0 G M)/(4 pi G r^2): r^-2 exactly, coefficient 1
